{"synopsis":"Jiang Xiaoyong, yang dibunuh akibat pengkhianatan seorang wanita licik di dunia yang penuh kekacauan, tiba-tiba terlahir kembali setahun sebelum bencana besar.\nDengan hadiah dari sistem kotak misterius Doomsday, ia melangkah lebih jauh dari yang lain, mengumpulkan Suplai dan membangun markas yang tak tertembus dengan menghabiskan kekayaan yang melimpah.\nMelalui kekuatan sistem yang terus berkembang, ia membalas dendam pada musuh-musuh dari kehidupan sebelumnya dan memulai perjalanan epik menuju puncak kejayaan sebagai penguasa yang tak tertandingi.","alternative_title":"末世重生：我靠开箱子问鼎巅峰","author":"A bit of pen studio","artist":"A bit of pen studio","chapters":[{"number":"103","chapter":"103","slug":"39b3411d-dde3-4fca-9625-d4e0a3aad863","date":"2026-06-04","images":[]},{"number":"102","chapter":"102","slug":"e0db8177-c934-4563-a31a-8baef2eed46f","date":"2026-06-03","images":[]},{"number":"101","chapter":"101","slug":"e97ec374-f4d5-45e1-aa06-95cf48bf49f3","date":"2026-05-29","images":[]},{"number":"100","chapter":"100","slug":"5d38b075-2329-4d9a-ad26-f65d3c3a3a75","date":"2026-05-12","images":[]},{"number":"99","chapter":"99","slug":"6e74b1ff-36c7-45b2-a417-5d67bd7127df","date":"2026-05-09","images":[]},{"number":"98","chapter":"98","slug":"ae0eb0a0-9159-4602-b359-28a08afe6642","date":"2026-05-09","images":[]},{"number":"97","chapter":"97","slug":"0248b1ab-9e6f-41ee-b8de-c9f796d30ef3","date":"2026-04-21","images":[]},{"number":"96","chapter":"96","slug":"2a4d17b4-afb3-4daf-af9c-3fe8d86fcf59","date":"2026-04-14","images":[]},{"number":"95","chapter":"95","slug":"16c2546c-9418-4129-abdf-b78c67ebd969","date":"2026-04-05","images":[]},{"number":"94","chapter":"94","slug":"9c6a8667-94eb-48b4-8f7e-40efeb1636a0","date":"2026-04-04","images":[]},{"number":"93","chapter":"93","slug":"ac66e8dd-3a3c-4a09-9f2f-5f5cd3f67f6f","date":"2026-03-29","images":[]},{"number":"92","chapter":"92","slug":"46f420aa-ddc1-4ea7-818b-6091d9b6284e","date":"2026-03-22","images":[]},{"